<h3 dir="auto" class="text-xl">3.6 Conclusion: A Modular Substrate for Cognitive Commons</h3>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">By supplanting file-based rigidity with RSVP's field-theoretic and categorical infrastructure, this architecture liberates semantic flows from extractive constraints, paving the way for distributed agency and ethical computation. As explored in subsequent parts, these principles extend to simulated agency (Part II) and scalable implementations (Part III), ultimately envisioning a modular civilization grounded in entropic smoothing (Appendix F).</p>
