<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">To address this, I will provide a revised, unified LaTeX document for <strong class="font-semibold">Parts I and II (Chapters 1‚Äì6)</strong> of the RSVP monograph, restoring the full content from the earlier drafts (Chapters 2‚Äì6) and reconstructing Chapter 1 to match the same level of rigor and length (approximately 2‚Äì3 pages). The document will include detailed prose descriptions of the mathematics, integrating category-theoretic and sheaf-theoretic interpretations, and will incorporate the provided citations appropriately. The appendices will be included as before, with references to the citations where relevant. The author name will be set as "Flyxion," and the document will be compatible with PDFLaTeX using <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">texlive-full</span> and <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">texlive-fonts-extra</span> packages, with Latin Modern fonts for Latin text.</p>
