&nbsp;
HYDRA and TARTAN realize RSVP‚Äôs vision of modular, distributed intelligence. HYDRA
governs local RSVP dynamics at the node level; TARTAN ensures functorial alignment
at the global level. Together, they create networks where agency is modular,
entropy-respecting, and resistant to monopolistic capture. These architectures
prepare the way for Part IV, where RSVP principles extend to cosmology and the
design of a modular civilization.
