<li class="break-words">Implementation Roadmap</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Phase 1: Prototype Simulation</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Small-scale lattice (32√ó32) with basic advection-diffusion rules.</p>
