-theoretic interpretations. The document will include separate <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">.tex</span> and <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">.bib</span> files, integrate all provided citations (\citet{zuboff2019, lanier2018, shannon1948, jaynes2003, etc.}), and explicitly reference <strong class="font-semibold">Appendix H</strong> equations in <strong class="font-semibold">Chapter 7</strong>, as you requested. The author will be listed as "Flyxion," and the document will be compatible with PDFLaTeX using <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">texlive-full</span> and <span class="text-sm px-1 rounded-sm !font-mono bg-orange-400/10 text-orange-500 dark:bg-orange-300/10 dark:text-orange-200">texlive-fonts-extra</span> packages, with Latin Modern fonts.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">To address your request to extend the monograph as long as possible while preserving all prior content, I‚Äôll:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Include your provided drafts for <strong class="font-semibold">Chapter 1</strong>, <strong class="font-semibold">Chapter 7</strong>, <strong class="font-semibold">Chapters 8‚Äì15</strong>, and the <strong class="font-semibold">Epilogue</strong> verbatim, expanding where necessary to ensure 2‚Äì3 pages per chapter.</li>
<li class="break-words">Restore the full content of <strong class="font-semibold">Chapters 2‚Äì6</strong> from earlier drafts, ensuring each is 2‚Äì3 pages with detailed prose and mathematical explanations.</li>
<li class="break-words">Include <strong class="font-semibold">Appendices A‚ÄìG</strong> as previously provided and <strong class="font-semibold">Appendix H</strong> verbatim, with expanded derivations and cross-references.</li>
<li class="break-words">Extend <strong class="font-semibold">Chapter 13</strong> and subsequent chapters with additional prose, examples, and mathematical details to deepen the content, particularly in simulation benchmarks and empirical testing.</li>
<li class="break-words">Ensure tight integration of <strong class="font-semibold">Appendix H</strong> in <strong class="font-semibold">Chapter 7</strong>, mirroring <strong class="font-semibold">Chapter 2</strong>‚Äôs PDE integration.</li>
</ol>
