<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">(Appendix H.1) \citep{bird1988}. TARTAN recursively tiles fields with annotated noise, ensuring interpretability at multiple scales (Appendix H.3) \citep{milewski2018}. Together, they scaffold simulations from individual households to planetary networks \citep{friston2010}.
